msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A0DBAAC_D426_42C5_921F_9B4005812851"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Until around the time I turned seventeen,⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫my life was mostly uneventful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Até por volta da época em que completei dezessete anos,⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫minha vida foi praticamente "
"monótona."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4A0DC88F_34D9_40EF_ADFC_B77F3EC02EC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3702538eac5fb432374892779895b0b49cd83451c71ddeb57971cb444d5faff8
#. default-sha256: 76395ad0ddfdfd96ad2836f07a015def75c50f1e07324e384de056f5f414c245
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4A0DC88F_34D9_40EF_ADFC_B77F3EC02EC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You have the same flax-colored hair as me,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but yours always seemed to glisten "
"in the sun,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Você tem o mesmo cabelo cor de linho que eu,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫mas o seu sempre pareceu brilhar "
"ao sol,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F22859B9_3BF8_4FBD_BCCD_258FBB8B2151
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10577a73ac160fc6405957c84b4a3ef67090372e96e954620fe8be58ca04fdae
