msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I genuinely wanted it to be."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu realmente queria que fosse."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B97BE98D_2583_4169_BB9B_190473D8D892
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b43566b0fbf5839647792f200da095a27cfe4272289f19d8dfb941117bbb7dfd
