msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Embora eu tivesse recebido algum dinheiro, meu estoque estava longe de ser "
"infinito."

#: scenario8:scenario8_82E75C7D_E266_4212_B9D5_E4F4EA426959
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7375d4a44a9f7b231faf74c045c0e14ab0f99e5c7d9ee1807c948430b4f7b67f
