msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_82E75C7D_E266_4212_B9D5_E4F4EA426959"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I would eventually have to find some kind of work—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫some way to support "
"myself and Nellie—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu sabia que eventualmente teria que encontrar algum tipo de trabalho—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫alguma "
"maneira de sustentar a mim e a Nellie—"

#: scenario8:scenario8_52024431_DA1B_4142_8E3B_0376C8AE6A45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92d5cbdc3411da63504b63bac9714a111e35f25203f34188bb0a089d14f24e0a
